// Hammer moveset (WP-051). Source: docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md, "Weapon classes": blunt
// damage and high poise damage, medium speed, 1.8 m reach, Might. Frame numbers are tuning
// unless a spec line says otherwise. Hits are Blunt, so the poise damage is high and the
// strikes are slow. Dodges (roll, backstep) are shared in common.ron; the critical pair is
// shared in crits.ron, and the weapon's crit_mult_percent (100) sets the crit.
// total_frames = startup + active + recovery; a hitbox window is (startup, startup + active - 1).
// Schema: crates/content/src/moves.rs.
